# Pairs with RAllOrNothing. A sub-saga a pre-upgrade silo purged reaches the
# receiver only as committed rows. Without the uniform-verdict arrival (#4684's
# R2) the import serves the tree post-saga while the barrier, already holding the
# sibling's final tally, waits for an arrival that never comes.
MODULE: RAllOrNothingCrossTreeImportNoUniformArrival
TARGET: RAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an import whose export names a decided operation in no row leaves the tree pending in its barrier
PERTURBS: Bootstrap
BOUNDS: LossPath = 0, JoinStart = 1, SagaOutcome = 0, Shape = 1, PreHold = 1, DialFaults = 0

--- FIND
         /\ BarrierImport(snap)
         /\ outbox' = {r \in outbox : ~Aff(r)} \cup kept
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: only a decision row records an arrival.
         /\ rout' = IF ViaBarrier(snap) THEN [rout EXCEPT !["A"] = snap] ELSE rout
         /\ rstage' = IF ViaBarrier(snap) /\ rstage["A"] = "idle"
                      THEN [rstage EXCEPT !["A"] = "register"] ELSE rstage
         /\ afence' = (afence \/ ViaBarrier(snap))
         /\ outbox' = {r \in outbox : ~Aff(r)} \cup kept
--- END
